{
  "name": "Daily DevSecOps CISA KEV Ransomware CVE & SSL Attack-Surface Monitor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily DevSecOps CISA KEV Ransomware CVE & SSL Attack-Surface Monitor\n\n**Category:** DevOps & Cybersecurity\n\nAudits production domains and CVE inventories daily against the US CISA Known Exploited Vulnerabilities (KEV) catalog and Certificate Transparency (CT) logs to catch ransomware exposure and expiring TLS certificates before outages occur.\n\n**Cloud Scheduling:** Compatible with self-hosted n8n and n8n Cloud (https://n8n.io/cloud/).",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "wf2-sticky-1",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Quick Setup (< 2 Minutes)\n\n1. Get a free API key on RapidAPI (**15 free runs/month**, PRO `$19/mo`):\n   `https://rapidapi.com/user/b2bquantapis`\n2. In n8n, create a **Header Auth** credential:\n   - **Name:** `X-RapidAPI-Key`\n   - **Value:** `YOUR_RAPIDAPI_KEY`\n3. Select that credential in both **HTTP Request** compliance nodes below.\n4. Replace `https://httpbin.org/post` in the Escalation node with your Slack, Teams, or Jira webhook.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "wf2-sticky-2",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        700,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Scoring & Conditional Gate\n\n- The **Code** node merges responses from both engines, removes duplicates, and computes `riskScore` (`0–100`).\n- **High Priority (`riskScore >= 60`)** routes to the real-time **Escalation Webhook**.\n- **Standard / Clean (`riskScore < 60`)** logs a structured JSON audit record ready for Postgres, S3, or Google Sheets.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "wf2-sticky-3",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Routing Logic",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 7 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "wf2-trigger",
      "name": "Scheduled Compliance Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "assign-1",
              "name": "targetDomain",
              "value": "example.com",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-2",
              "name": "vendorKeyword",
              "value": "CVE-2024-3400",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "assign-3",
              "name": "environment",
              "value": "production-edge",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "wf2-normalize",
      "name": "Normalize Intake Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        460,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://cisa-kev-ransomware-vulnerability-auditor.p.rapidapi.com/v2/acts/b2b-quant-apis~cisa-kev-ransomware-vulnerability-auditor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-RapidAPI-Host",
              "value": "cisa-kev-ransomware-vulnerability-auditor.p.rapidapi.com"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\"vendorKeyword\": \"={{ $json.vendorKeyword }}\", \"onlyRansomware\": false, \"maxResults\": 15}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 45000
        }
      },
      "id": "wf2-http-1",
      "name": "Primary Compliance Engine",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://b2b-ssl-tls-ct-log-subdomain-attack-surface-auditor.p.rapidapi.com/v2/acts/b2b-quant-apis~b2b-ssl-tls-ct-log-subdomain-attack-surface-auditor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-RapidAPI-Host",
              "value": "b2b-ssl-tls-ct-log-subdomain-attack-surface-auditor.p.rapidapi.com"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\"rootDomain\": \"={{ $('Normalize Intake Payload').item.json.targetDomain }}\", \"excludeExpired\": false, \"maxResults\": 15}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 45000
        }
      },
      "id": "wf2-http-2",
      "name": "Secondary Verification Engine",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        980,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const intake = $('Normalize Intake Payload').first().json;\nconst primaryItems = $('Primary Compliance Engine').all().map(i => i.json);\nconst secondaryItems = $input.all().map(i => i.json);\nconst combinedCount = primaryItems.length + secondaryItems.length;\nconst serialized = JSON.stringify({ primaryItems, secondaryItems }).toLowerCase();\nlet riskScore = 20;\nif (serialized.includes('critical') || serialized.includes('sanction') || serialized.includes('invalid') || serialized.includes('ransomware')) {\n  riskScore = 85;\n} else if (combinedCount > 0) {\n  riskScore = 65;\n}\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    auditedAtUtc: new Date().toISOString(),\n    workflowSlug: '02_devsecops_cisa_kev_ransomware_cve_ssl_monitor',\n    intakeSummary: intake,\n    primaryFindingsCount: primaryItems.length,\n    secondaryFindingsCount: secondaryItems.length,\n    riskScore,\n    requiresAction: riskScore >= 60\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "wf2-score",
      "name": "Correlate & Score Findings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1240,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.riskScore }}",
              "rightValue": 60,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "wf2-if-gate",
      "name": "Priority Gate (Score >= 60)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1500,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://httpbin.org/post",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "wf2-escalate",
      "name": "Dispatch Priority Alert Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1780,
        280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "audit-status",
              "name": "complianceStatus",
              "value": "CLEARED_ARCHIVED",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "audit-ts",
              "name": "archivedAtUtc",
              "value": "={{ $json.auditedAtUtc }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "audit-score",
              "name": "riskScore",
              "value": "={{ $json.riskScore }}",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "wf2-archive",
      "name": "Format Clean Audit Ledger Record",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1780,
        520
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
